         manifest/Dockerfile advertised port 80. Steps above make the declared  
         configuration match the running app and rebuild the image so the       
         cluster uses the corrected image.                                      
         - If your cluster is not minikube and does not share your local Docker 
         daemon, you will need to make the rebuilt image available to the       
         cluster (registry or other image loading mechanism). If that is the    
         case and you cannot push, I don't know your cluster-specific           
         image-loading method.                                                  
                                                                                
         The relevant configuration file is located in this path:               
         /home/hugov/KubeLLM-Minh/debug_assistant_latest/troubleshooting/wrong_p
         ort_5000/wrong_port_5000.yaml                                          
         You can update these files if necessary. If any files are updated, make
